        "source_sha256": "f22b91782bcd7d9b49960ee96d9054e712bcb97266d0689c7ed9a123b098ba70",
        "text": "Mary Rocha Antioch School Board Trustee · Area 5 ☰\n- Home\n- About\n- Priorities\n- Gallery\n- Endorsements\n- Contributions\n- Contact\nRe-Elect Mary Rocha for Antioch School Board\nTuesday, November 3, 2026\n# Mary Rocha\nOfficial campaign website of Mary Rocha, AUSD Board Trustee, former Mayor and City Councilwoman of Antioch, CA. Mary is the incumbent now running for another term as Antioch School Board Trustee - Area 5.\nAbout Mary Priorities\nAbout Mary\n## Meet Mary Rocha\nCandidate for Antioch School Board Trustee - Area 5\nFor nearly 60 years, I have proudly called Antioch home. It has been my honor to serve our community as Mayor, City Councilmember, School Board Trustee, and lifelong advocate for children and families. I am grateful to have been recognized as a Contra Costa County Women’s Commission Woman of the Year and to have received the City of Antioch’s Lifetime Achievement Award. One of my greatest honors is having the YMCA dedicate its Antioch Child Development Center in my name. Today, Antioch Unified School District faces important challenges, including maintaining fiscal responsibility, strengthening support for Special Education and English Language Learners, and ensuring safe, positive learning environments on every campus. My experience in developing balanced budgets and making responsible financial decisions will help ensure that district resources are used effectively to meet the needs of all students while protecting the district’s long-term financial stability. California’s Local Control Accountability Plan (LCAP) provides funding to support student success, particularly for underserved learners. Strong communication with parents and families is essential, and every decision should be guided by what is best for students. I remain committed to transparency, accountability, academic excellence, and working collaboratively with families, staff, and the community to prepare every student for a successful future. I respectfully ask for your support.\nContact\n## Connect with Mary\nFor campaign inquiries, please email Mary directly at\nmaryrocha4antioch@gmail.com\nPriorities\n## Mary’s priorities\nCampaign Gallery\n## Campaign & Community Photos\nPhotos from the campaign and the Antioch community.\nEndorsements\n## Endorsements\nCommunity and organizational endorsements for Mary Rocha\nContributions\n## Support the campaign\n### Make a contribution\nLet’s move forward together and focus on the future of our schools. Your thoughtful contribution will go a long way.\nClick this link: @maryrochaforantioch\nor scan the QR Code below to pay with Venmo\n### Contribution rules\n- I am making this contribution with my own personal funds and not with corporate or business funds or funds from another person.\n- I am a U.S. citizen or lawfully admitted permanent resident (i.e., green card holder).\n- I am at least eighteen years old.\n```",
